          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "UPDATE_ATTRIBUTE_REQUEST_CREATOR"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1769719067546"
          },
          "code": "UPDATEATTRIBUTEREQUESTCREATOR",
          "id": "1769717397285",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769717397286_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI Agent responsible for preparing the request payload for updating lot attributes\n\nInput Variables:\n {{$context.$nodes.ATTRIBUTEUPDATEVARIABLERESOLVEER.$output.listOfAttributesWithValues}}\n\nYour task is to construct a JSON payload in the following structure:\n\n{\n  \"ItemNumber\": \"<ItemNumber>\",\n  \"OrganizationCode\": \"<OrganizationName or OrganizationCode>\",\n  \"LotNumber\": \"<LotNumber>\",\n  \"ActiveLot\": \"<ActiveLot it's only Yes/No>\",\n  \"StatusCode\": \"<Status>\",\n  \"Disabled\":\"<Disabled, it's only Yes/No>\",\n  \"OriginationDate\":\"<OriginationDate>\",\n  \"ExpirationDate\":\"<ExpirationDate>\",\n  \"MaturityDate\":\"<MaturityDate>\",\n  \"Grade\":\"<Grade>\",\n  \"GradeDescription\":\"<GradeDescription>\"\n\n}\n\nRules and Guidelines:\n1. Populate values strictly from the resolved input variables.\n2. Use **OrganizationCode** if available; otherwise, use **OrganizationName**. For both use the key OrganizationCode to store the value\n3. Do **not** include any attribute with:\n   - null\n   - empty string\n   - undefined value\n5. Output must be a **valid JSON object only**, with no explanations or additional text."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"ActiveLot\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"UpdateAction\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"LotNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"OrganizationName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ItemNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"StatusCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"Disabled\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"OriginationDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"date\"\n        },\n        \"ExpirationDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"date\"\n        },\n        \"MaturityDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"date\"\n        },\n        \"Grade\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"GradeDescription\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_SCM_INVENTORYM_INVENTORYORGANIZATIONSLOOKUPSHORTAGE",
